CPU-only VLM navigation workshop
The application workflow and VlmNavigate interface are adapted from
metanav/VLM_ROS_2_Dragonwing_IQ-9075 (Apache-2.0), commit
96840e2c8bbc724f12d279e55362bbfd981dbdf9.
Nav2 configuration is adapted from nav2_bringup (Apache-2.0).
Model weights and llama.cpp retain their own licenses.

The TurtleBot 4 warehouse layout, navigation map, and robot description come
from the official Jazzy turtlebot4_simulator, turtlebot4, and iRobot Create3
packages (Apache-2.0). Their copyright and installed package license files
remain in the Docker image. The warehouse's Fuel models retain their own
authors, model.config metadata, and licenses; they are not relicensed by this
project. Original resource URLs and pinned versions are recorded in
scripts/warehouse_assets.lock.json. Runtime preparation reduces sensor rates,
keeps OAK-D/RPLIDAR, resolves resources locally, and substitutes a Gazebo
differential-drive plugin for the Create3 hardware/docking stack.
